{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54721","headline":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占月第十二（京本列第七○二十三首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出军夜，看月好参详。\n有兔主人占大胜，兔无反（京本作「无兔还」）是客军强，仔细审形相（京本作「须要细端详」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}